{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\"><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>現年73歲的「心姐」謝雪心向來保養得宜、氣質優雅，是圈中公認的美魔女。日前，謝雪心於社交平台分享了一段短片，大談對年紀的看法，穿上碎花吊帶裙上陣的她，其逆齡身材與優雅氣質瞬間成為焦點！</span></p><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_f8e2b87df1d88330-2268\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>從片段中可見，謝雪心膚質平滑透亮、紅唇齒白，穿上一襲綠色碎花吊帶長裙，外搭白色蕾絲開衫外套，整體造型優雅大方之餘，亦不乏性感一面。</span></p><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></h3><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"28f4a09f-1e43-4ff1-80b8-8c69abd113d4.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026chs1iVFY121789440784.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"28f4a09f-1e43-4ff1-80b8-8c69abd113d4.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"178607c5-d953-4686-b2ea-ffe5cc6099ed.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026qC4uHGK46I1789440784.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"178607c5-d953-4686-b2ea-ffe5cc6099ed.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_f8e2b87df1d88330-2269\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>談及年齡話題時，謝雪心：「年紀從來都不是束縛你的枷鎖，只要你心裡面還有一團火，你還要好熱愛這一團火，無論你是30歲還是60歲，都可以活得充實、有聲有色。」</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_f8e2b87df1d88330-2269\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_f8e2b87df1d88330-2270\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>不少網民看完短片後紛紛留言激讚謝雪心狀態完美，並十分贊同其人生觀，大讚她是「優雅地老去嘅最佳示範」，並直言「心裡面有火，人就永遠年輕！」</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-15T03:20:33.141256+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":305,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}